{
    "title": "Apple Carplay",
    "description": "Apple Carplay app is a Mirror link app with Apple Carplay Style.\r\nOnce your Apple Carplay Phone is connected to a compatible car, the application allows you to use various applications via the car's touchscreen, steering wheel controls or voice recognition systems.\r\n\r\nSome notable features of Apple Car play include:\r\n* Maps - With Apple Car play, your Phone can function as a satellite navigation system.\r\n* Phone - As expected, you can use your phone as a phone with Apple Carplay.\r\n* Messages - You can send and receive messages, with the ability to read them aloud while driving.\r\n* Music - Apple Carplay lets you listen to music from apps.\r\n\r\nApple CarPlay: App Directions serves as a guide for people new to the Apple Carplay app. We provide instructions on how to edit Maps on Apple Carplay, as well as comprehensive information on all aspects of Apple Carplay.\r\n\r\nThe main features of Apple CarPlay\r\n+ Troubleshooting guide to fix issues with Apple Car play\r\n+ Tips for using Apple Car play app head units\r\n+ Instructions for using Apple Car play app with your Phone\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nis just an educational purpose app that will help friends to better understand Apple Carplay guide.\r\nThe content in this app is not affiliated with, endorsed, sponsored, or specifically approved by any party or organization.\r\nWe provide information from various reliable sources, available on many websites.",
